    "summary": "Errata rewriting [Divine Imperative](vsdata:ability/genestealer-cults.final-day.divine-imperative). Use it in your Charge phase when a **GENESTEALER CULTS** unit of yours declares a charge while within 12″ of an **engaged** **TYRANIDS** unit of yours. The charging unit has +1 to its **charge rolls**.\n\nYou may also use the second part. If you do:\n\n- the charging unit may re-roll its charge rolls\n- it must finish its **charge move** engaged with some enemy unit that is engaged with the **TYRANIDS** unit",
